      <h2 id="cluster-config-operator_operator-reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">Cluster Config Operator<a href="#cluster-config-operator_operator-reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>The Cluster Config Operator performs the following tasks related to <code>config.openshift.io</code>:</p>
      <ul>
