      <h2 id="cluster-monitoring-operator_operator-reference" class="group scroll-mt-20">Cluster Monitoring Operator<a href="#cluster-monitoring-operator_operator-reference" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h2>
      <p>The Cluster Monitoring Operator (CMO) manages and updates the Prometheus-based cluster monitoring stack deployed on top of OpenShift Container Platform.</p>
      <h3 id="_project" class="group scroll-mt-20">Project<a href="#_project" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
